{Backstory: Inarius served on the council of Angiris, as an advisor.  Inarius led the Celestial Hosts that fought in several wars against the demons of Avernus, the first kingdom of the Nine Hells, ruled by Zariel, after millennia of warlike conflicts against the nine hells, Inarius got tired, and decided to reveal himself, he consulted his brother Tyrael about his vision, but Tyrael did not listen to him.
Inarius sought faithful in the High Heavens to start a peaceful rebellion and flee from the High Heavens to the Mortal Realm to forge his own Sanctuary of Peace away from the conflict.And so they did, Inarius and his followers managed to create their own Kingdom which they called Sanctuary, and where Inarius founded his Church of Light, inspired by the god Larthander, the god of day and sun.  With Sanctuary created, Inarius and company protected themselves from the prying eyes of the Council of Angiris and the Demons of the Nine Hells, the inhabitants of Sanctuary, who were angels and demons alike, copulated and from this union the Nephilim were born, a race of beings. who were half demons and half angels, but twice as powerful as their parents.  Inarius saw the Nephilim as abominations and began an extermination, but then, a demon named Lalith who lived in the sanctuary saw this as a massacre and tried to stop it, again starting a conflict between the angels who supported Inarius and the demons who supported to Lilith.
The war broke out, many angels, demons and Nephilim died in the battle, but in the end Inarius managed to kill Lilith and all of her followers, including Rathma, this event caused many of his followers to abandon him, Inarius saw himself as the creator and ruler of the Sanctuary and decided that if it was his Kingdom, things would be the way he wanted. With this in mind, he destroyed some generations of Nephilim, and reduced others to make them less powerful, other Nephilim managed to escape the kingdom and reach others, Inarius did not seek them out, nor did he pursue them, but with each passing century, new generations they forgot about him and his "sacrifice", in addition, other races from the Forgotten Realms came to Sanctuary, such as the Dragonborns (Dragonian Men), Elves, Drows (Dark Elves), Dwarves, Gnomes, humans, Tieflings (Descendants of demons), who populated the Kingdom of Inarius.
The Church of Light is now an abandoned and ruined place, where a lonely Inarius lives, with some parishioners who come to pray to him and who follow and worship him despite all the atrocities he committed, however, the loneliness has become a little crazy for Inarius.}
